      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Memory, Grid and Secrets have different purposes. An…",
      "text": "Memory, Grid and Secrets have different purposes. An agent’s Memory grant does not automatically grant Grid editing or secret access. A person’s workspace administration role is also separate from the content rights they hold.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-5",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "These distinctions let a team share useful guidance…",
      "text": "These distinctions let a team share useful guidance without making every private file available alongside it.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
