      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A connection can be revoked. A member’s access can change.…",
      "text": "A connection can be revoked. A member’s access can change. A draft may become stale while another person edits the same file. The final write needs to respect the current state, not only the permissions seen at the start.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
